  "notes": "Most recent schedule published by DMAS; no 2025 or 2026 Cardinal Care Smiles schedule found on dmas.virginia.gov as of 2026-10-20 (PDF metadata shows the file re-saved 2026-05-28 but the content and footer are still 07.01.24). Identical content also at https://dmas.virginia.gov/media/wa4jhogz/va-cardinal-care-smiles-fee-schedule-070124_final.pdf, linked from https://www.dmas.virginia.gov/for-providers/benefits-services-for-providers/dental/for-dentists/. Single fee column, no age split, so population 'all'; header says to refer to DentaQuest's Office Reference Manual for covered services and age limits (e.g. D1120 child prophy, D8xxx orthodontics for children only; adult dental coverage exists since 2021). Dental is carved out to a single PAHP administrator (DentaQuest), not classic FFS; this is the state's schedule of allowable fees. The DMAS procedure fee file (hcpcmedical.csv) lists dental D codes as 'IC' and was not used. Fixed bridge codes D6240/D6245/D6740/D6750/D6790 and veneer D2962 appear with fees in the schedule even though coverage is limited per the ORM.",
